WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
- Yeah.
- So would you do a reboot?

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.133
Would y'all do it?

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.920
- We talk about this all the time.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.460
We wanna do a reunion special.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.160
Like a reason that everyone in the office

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.190
has to reunite for some reason,

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.059
like a one-time special episode.

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:13.892
- Like a movie!

00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:14.730
Like a reunion movie.
- Like a movie.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.167
Yeah, because I think
a reboot would be hard.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:20.101
At the end of the series, spoiler alert

00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:21.850
for anyone who's still
in the middle of it,

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.250
but some of the people
don't end up staying

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.940
at the paper company anymore.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.520
They move on, they move away.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.380
And so to manufacture some reason why

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.635
we're all working there
again I think would be odd.

00:00:31.635 --> 00:00:33.400
But I think there is a reason that

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.160
we could all reunite in some other way.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:35.993
So that's what we're--

00:00:35.993 --> 00:00:36.826
- We have some ideas.
- That's what we want.

00:00:36.826 --> 00:00:38.650
Call us.
- Call us NBC.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.100
- NBC.
- Email us.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:40.940
- I think it would be so good.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.200
Like I said, it's just
got such a new life.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.894
Like a younger age are getting

00:00:44.894 --> 00:00:47.170
into these characters, it's really cool.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.770
- And on a selfish level, I would like

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.070
to work with all those people again.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.426
I'd like to have us
all in a room together.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.259
- Yes!

00:00:52.259 --> 00:00:54.210
- It's such a great
chemistry, great vibe, yeah.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.690
- I teared up when I got here
because your security guy,

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:57.888
Joseph outside, did security

00:00:57.888 --> 00:00:59.921
for "The Office" for seven years.

00:00:59.921 --> 00:01:01.570
We saw him every day.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:03.470
- We gave Joseph a big hug.
- We gave him a big hug.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.846
He used to help me when
my daughter came to set.

00:01:05.846 --> 00:01:08.580
I had like a little, you
know the little pink car

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.780
you push your kid around
in and it's really loud,

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:11.790
it's like (imitates clanking).

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.370
- Yeah, and everyone loves you.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:14.210
- Everyone loves you.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:15.260
I would like push her around,

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.060
and Joseph would like help me take it out

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.210
and set it out, and he
was just a sweetheart.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.961
But I would love to see everyone again.

00:01:20.961 --> 00:01:21.794
- It would be amazing.
- We might

00:01:21.794 --> 00:01:24.251
have to steal Joseph for
that week of shooting,

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:25.084
if you don't mind, we want everyone.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.563
- That's okay, I'm okay with that.

